{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "game": "hsr",
  "id": "a-note-from-cerydra",
  "name": "A Note from Cerydra",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/A_Note_from_Cerydra",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-08-03T10:35:34.700Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To the Deliverer from beyond the sky,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The game is decided. Your conquest and mine are done."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But you should know this battle is by no means the end of the Imperator's path."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I have seen that the universe is far more vast than what mortal eyes can behold."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Even if I must relive this life, I shall one day travel beyond the sky, even if it takes a thousand ages."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Then, I will resume the great journey, until my conquest among the sea of stars is complete."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "This is not a vision for Amphoreus, but an ironclad law I decree for my empire:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"Your people shall march across the wilds, taking the very universe as their granary, and slaying all foes who must be slain.\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Accept this king piece as a testament to this law and as a bounty from your Imperator."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It followed me into battle, rode with me across the plains, returned with me in triumph, and was with me as I shattered the laws of nations."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Now, like a weight I cast upon the scales, it shall compel victory to bow to you."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-a1ebb60ad5804ca6"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Carry this piece to a grander board."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And when the Imperator returns, you can fight for my law once more."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Or defy it, and challenge me to a game."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-a979e262d61a9e2b"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The Imperator of Amphoreus"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6a7e96d9e01d1717"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
